# Staging directory for the console bundle compiled into midnight-server by
# internal/api/webui_embed.go (`//go:embed all:webdist`).
#
# Contents are a verbatim copy of web-next/dist produced by `make web-embed`
# (or `task web:embed`) and are never committed: the console is a build output,
# not source. Only this file is tracked, which keeps the directory present so a
# fresh checkout still compiles — a binary built without running web-embed
# reports the console as unavailable at "/" and `make build-server` refuses to
# produce it at all.
*
!.gitignore
